This is an independent project, built for the OpenGOAL ecosystem
(https://github.com/open-goal/jak-project). It is not affiliated with the
OpenGOAL team, nor endorsed or supported by it. What it knows of the game's
animation format comes from OpenGOAL's build_actor tool and research.

The Jak and Daxter games belong to Sony Interactive Entertainment and were
developed by Naughty Dog. No data of the games comes with this project: the
models it edits are the user's own files.

The fonts in src/assets/fonts/ keep their own licenses (OFL.txt, LICENSE.txt).
